WEBVTT

00:47.089 --> 00:48.090
Hey.

00:49.174 --> 00:50.217
Heeju.

02:20.307 --> 02:21.350
Huh?

02:23.769 --> 02:25.646
What the hell?

02:40.160 --> 02:41.411
Shit.

02:48.210 --> 02:49.878
That's enough.

02:51.421 --> 02:52.922
Just put the gold in the car.

02:52.923 --> 02:56.217
Hey, you're messing with me.

02:56.218 --> 02:57.594
It's not loaded, right?

03:09.064 --> 03:10.357
Shut up and don't say anything!

03:12.317 --> 03:15.070
The gold.
Put it in the back of the car.

03:18.281 --> 03:20.325
Okay. I'll do it.

03:36.925 --> 03:38.760
CHAIRMAN AHN GYUSEOK
INCOMING CALL

03:41.930 --> 03:42.973
Yes, Chairman.

03:43.390 --> 03:44.558
Did you find the casket?

03:46.601 --> 03:48.937
Not yet.
I'm close, though, sir.

03:51.440 --> 03:54.150
Didn't you say you found out who
the accomplice was?

03:54.151 --> 03:55.444
Lee Dokyung's girl.

03:56.987 --> 03:58.154
Yes, that's right.

03:58.155 --> 04:00.407
I'm actually after her right now, sir.
Don't worry.

04:01.324 --> 04:02.533
I'm on it.

04:02.534 --> 04:04.911
- I'll make sure to find the gold no-
-  Gold?

04:15.922 --> 04:17.966
Fuck me.

04:24.723 --> 04:26.641
- Chief Cheon.
-  Yes, sir.

04:27.976 --> 04:29.977
Can we wrap things up here today?

04:29.978 --> 04:31.229
Yes, sir.
We're almost done.

04:33.899 --> 04:35.525
Tie up any loose ends now.

04:37.319 --> 04:38.945
We're going to Jeongsan tomorrow.
:cue

04:39.821 --> 04:40.822
Yes, Chairman.

05:35.710 --> 05:38.796
EPISODE 6
FISSURE

05:38.797 --> 05:41.716
INCLINED SHAFT 8, SECTION 0
100ML

05:49.599 --> 05:51.560
Ah, shit.
This is fucking hard.

05:52.727 --> 05:53.895
Heeju!

05:54.688 --> 05:56.730
Ah, this is the last of it.

05:58.149 --> 05:59.692
If you had done this
by yourself,

05:59.693 --> 06:01.777
ah, I bet it would have taken all day.

06:06.491 --> 06:07.701
Okay.

06:09.119 --> 06:11.912
Now we just need to take care
of Cha Yujin, right?

06:11.913 --> 06:13.747
Then no one else knows.

06:13.748 --> 06:15.208
You know about it now, too.

06:15.959 --> 06:18.378
Come on. It's me.

06:19.087 --> 06:20.421
Heeju.

06:20.422 --> 06:21.631
I just want my share.
That's all.

06:23.258 --> 06:28.430
Okay, so now we just make potatoes
and sell them just like before.

06:29.472 --> 06:31.850
Sound good?
I'll still sell them.

06:40.150 --> 06:41.151
Okay.

06:43.904 --> 06:45.322
There. You can check the gold bars.

06:47.824 --> 06:48.949
Hmm?

06:48.950 --> 06:49.951
Yeah?

06:50.910 --> 06:51.911
Okay?

06:52.454 --> 06:53.663
So, we good?

06:54.205 --> 06:55.790
Don't come any closer.

06:57.417 --> 06:58.418
Really?

06:59.711 --> 07:01.587
You said Cha Yujin is on her way.

07:01.588 --> 07:03.505
You think you can kill her by yourself?

07:03.506 --> 07:05.716
I'll kill her for you, yeah?

07:05.717 --> 07:07.260
Just like I got rid
of Han Cheoljung for you.

07:09.763 --> 07:11.097
I can do it myself.

07:11.806 --> 07:12.807
Now move.

07:15.101 --> 07:16.477
- Over there?
- Just shut up!

07:16.478 --> 07:17.646
-  Okay, okay!
- Move out of the way.

07:24.486 --> 07:25.487
Turn around.

07:26.488 --> 07:27.489
Come on.

07:28.406 --> 07:29.531
Heeju, please don't do this.

07:29.532 --> 07:31.116
- Turn around.
-  Heeju.

07:31.117 --> 07:32.743
L-let's talk about this, okay?

07:32.744 --> 07:34.953
You and me.
We're in this together.

07:34.954 --> 07:35.955
Yeah?

07:36.790 --> 07:38.666
Hey, I saved your life, didn't I?

07:38.667 --> 07:40.377
But what?
You still don't trust me?

07:40.794 --> 07:42.127
I can't trust anyone.

07:42.128 --> 07:43.713
Okay, okay, okay, okay.

07:44.172 --> 07:45.256
Okay, how about this?

07:46.216 --> 07:47.926
I didn't see anything.

07:48.677 --> 07:50.886
I never saw a single gold bar.
I wasn't here.

07:50.887 --> 07:53.390
- I told you to turn around!
-  Okay, okay, okay, okay!

07:55.433 --> 07:56.434
Heeju, please.

07:57.102 --> 07:58.228
Please, just calm down.

07:59.854 --> 08:01.314
Please don't do this. Please?

08:01.940 --> 08:03.525
You know I'm always on your side, right?

08:04.359 --> 08:07.194
Even if everyone else betrays you,
I could never do that to you!

08:07.195 --> 08:08.780
Please just trust me, 'kay?

08:10.281 --> 08:11.282
Just fucking shoot me, then!

08:12.158 --> 08:13.284
But Kim Heeju...

08:14.369 --> 08:17.288
...if you do, I fucking swear that
you'll die right here with me, too.

08:37.559 --> 08:38.768
Dammit.

08:44.733 --> 08:45.816
Fuck.

08:49.571 --> 08:53.157
Take all of that cash
and the rest of the potatoes.

08:53.158 --> 08:55.076
That should be enough
to cover your share.

08:55.744 --> 08:57.871
Shouldn't it?
Now go.

08:59.956 --> 09:01.498
What about you?

09:01.499 --> 09:03.250
I can take care of myself.

09:03.251 --> 09:05.170
Don't come looking for me.

09:07.088 --> 09:08.923
Forget about everything you saw here.

09:09.632 --> 09:11.092
And move on with your life.

09:11.634 --> 09:14.137
If I ever see you again,
I don't know.

09:15.930 --> 09:18.141
I might actually shoot you.
:cue

09:19.517 --> 09:22.603
DAD! BE SAFE AGAIN TODAY

09:29.194 --> 09:32.112
INCLINED SHAFT 8, SECTION 0
100ML

09:44.000 --> 09:46.753
- You're sure?
- Please! Come on, just go! Go!

09:47.879 --> 09:48.880
Shit!

09:52.342 --> 09:53.676
Call me if you need anything.

09:54.677 --> 09:55.845
'Kay?

09:56.304 --> 09:57.847
I'm going. Okay?

10:06.981 --> 10:08.066
Dammit.

10:12.612 --> 10:14.363
Oh, shit.
Who's that?

10:14.364 --> 10:15.989
Fuck it, who cares?
Let's get outta here!

10:17.408 --> 10:18.700
Who the fuck is that?

10:31.631 --> 10:32.965
What do we do?

10:32.966 --> 10:34.591
Dammit, who...

10:34.592 --> 10:36.135
- Is that the boss?
- Huh?

10:36.136 --> 10:37.137
Ah, fuck!

10:46.146 --> 10:47.814
- Dammit, we're fucked.
-  What do we do? What do we do?

10:48.314 --> 10:49.481
We're fucking fucked.

10:57.657 --> 10:59.117
Fuck!

11:12.463 --> 11:14.423
Look out!

11:22.849 --> 11:23.932
Wait.

11:34.110 --> 11:36.196
It's Cha Yujin's car.

11:48.958 --> 11:49.959
She's dead.

11:51.169 --> 11:52.170
What?

11:58.676 --> 12:00.302
Give me the gun.

12:00.303 --> 12:01.304
What?

12:02.347 --> 12:04.056
Park might have seen us.
We have no other choice.

12:04.057 --> 12:05.350
We gotta kill the guy.

12:08.478 --> 12:09.603
Just give it to me.

12:12.857 --> 12:14.192
Wait!

12:16.194 --> 12:17.237
Just stay here!

12:17.779 --> 12:19.321
I'll be right back.

13:08.079 --> 13:09.080
Shit.

13:12.959 --> 13:14.334
Fuck.

13:22.218 --> 13:25.221
:cue

13:40.528 --> 13:41.820
Shit!

13:58.463 --> 13:59.881
Ah, shit.

14:05.428 --> 14:06.637
Shit.

14:07.221 --> 14:08.305
Dammit.

15:37.895 --> 15:39.063
TEAM LEADER CHA YUJIN
OUTGOING CALL

16:00.626 --> 16:02.295
Bitch!

16:33.492 --> 16:36.370
YANGPO JEIL HOSPITAL

16:44.879 --> 16:46.296
Ah, there.

16:47.673 --> 16:49.925
Okay, can you try standing?
Walking a little?

16:49.926 --> 16:51.343
-  Yeah.
- Careful.

16:54.513 --> 16:58.099
You'll likely have some pain
for a while so don't overdo it.

16:58.100 --> 17:00.352
-  All right, we're all done here.
-  Doctor.

17:00.353 --> 17:01.603
What?

17:01.604 --> 17:02.980
I'm very sorry about this.

17:23.417 --> 17:25.627
Shit!

17:32.385 --> 17:34.512
Could you please take me
to downtown Yangpo?

17:38.683 --> 17:41.977
Heeju, it's Dokyung.
I escaped from the hospital.

17:41.978 --> 17:43.771
Call me on this number.
:cue

17:58.995 --> 18:00.453
DIRECTOR PARK
INCOMING CALL

18:00.454 --> 18:02.747
Come on. Come on!

18:02.748 --> 18:05.000
- Yeah.
-  I need you to run a plate.

18:05.001 --> 18:06.377
Blue-colored Santa Fe.

18:06.711 --> 18:09.337
Last few digits,
five, two, seven, nine.

18:09.338 --> 18:11.673
No. What?
Hey! Hey, waiter!

18:11.674 --> 18:12.882
Hey!

18:16.262 --> 18:18.430
- Whose is it?
-  How the fuck would I know?

18:18.431 --> 18:20.640
That's why I'm telling you
to run the plates!

18:20.641 --> 18:23.185
If you can find the car, even better.

18:23.686 --> 18:25.187
Where's Cha Yujin now?

18:26.188 --> 18:28.941
I checked the whole area
but her Renegade wasn't there.

18:29.442 --> 18:30.776
Your car was, though.

18:34.030 --> 18:35.031
I lost her.

18:37.742 --> 18:38.743
Did you kill her?

18:39.410 --> 18:41.411
Just find the fucking Santa Fe!

18:41.412 --> 18:42.830
Can you do it today?

18:43.581 --> 18:45.499
I thought you wanted me
to stay out of it.

18:45.916 --> 18:47.668
Why do you keep doing this to me?

18:48.919 --> 18:50.087
This is the last time.

18:51.005 --> 18:53.174
The chairman,
he gets back tomorrow.

18:57.136 --> 18:59.847
Yeah, exactly.
I'm done helping you.

19:00.473 --> 19:03.099
If this thing goes wrong,
I'll be the one taking the fall.

19:03.100 --> 19:04.560
I'll give you
100 more gold chips.

19:08.898 --> 19:10.649
The hell is this man talking about?

19:10.650 --> 19:12.818
For fuck's sake,
fucking bastard.

19:13.444 --> 19:14.862
What'd I just say?

19:15.446 --> 19:17.113
I'm not doin' it.

19:17.114 --> 19:20.867
I bet you didn't even know
Lee Dokyung escaped from the hospital,

19:20.868 --> 19:23.704
did you?
Detective Kang is about to call you.

19:25.706 --> 19:27.667
I think you're fucked now, Park.

19:28.626 --> 19:30.211
Think carefully, now.

19:38.552 --> 19:40.221
This fucking asshole.

19:41.514 --> 19:43.181
Fuck that detective.

19:43.182 --> 19:44.517
Bastard.

19:47.937 --> 19:50.146
Is Kim Heeju the only one left now?

20:20.136 --> 20:21.178
Dammit.

20:58.215 --> 20:59.467
WOOGY
INCOMING CALL

21:01.844 --> 21:04.471
- Yes?
-  Hey, you fucking traitor!

21:04.472 --> 21:06.639
You ran off to save your own skin, huh?

21:06.640 --> 21:08.224
Some partner you are.

21:08.225 --> 21:10.560
You said you were gonna kill
Park Hocheol.

21:10.561 --> 21:12.188
Yeah, no shit!

21:12.980 --> 21:15.231
If you had just stayed there
like I said instead of running away,

21:15.232 --> 21:16.608
I could have killed him.

21:16.609 --> 21:18.193
Did Park see your face?

21:18.194 --> 21:19.445
I don't fucking know.

21:19.904 --> 21:21.571
It was so dark in there, I don't know.
I don't think so.

21:21.572 --> 21:22.698
What-what about you?

21:23.365 --> 21:26.076
I'm not sure.
I think he might have seen me.

21:26.911 --> 21:28.579
Ah, dammit.

21:30.331 --> 21:32.332
Wait for me at the workshop, okay?

21:32.333 --> 21:34.918
I'll go to the office tomorrow
and see how things are going.

21:34.919 --> 21:36.961
- Then I'll meet up with you.
-  No.

21:36.962 --> 21:39.047
I told you I never want to see you again.

21:39.048 --> 21:41.299
What the fuck
are you talking about, Heeju?

21:41.300 --> 21:42.884
Things have changed now.

21:42.885 --> 21:44.928
And my potatoes are still there in
the back of your car!

21:44.929 --> 21:46.055
I need those, you know.

21:49.433 --> 21:50.850
Ah, shit.

21:50.851 --> 21:52.310
Heeju, don't forget.

21:52.311 --> 21:53.394
I'm from Yes Money.

21:53.395 --> 21:55.188
I'll just leave it
for you at the workshop.

21:55.189 --> 21:56.564
Pick it up there.

21:56.565 --> 21:57.650
Okay.

21:58.317 --> 22:00.652
Oh, hey, hey, hey, hey, yeah, yeah.
Heeju, Heeju.
:cue

22:00.653 --> 22:02.446
Have you heard anything from Lee Dokyung?

22:03.155 --> 22:05.198
I haven't. Why?

22:05.199 --> 22:07.909
Well, apparently he escaped
from the fucking hospital.

22:07.910 --> 22:09.662
Yes Money's looking for him, too.

22:10.871 --> 22:12.039
Listen.

22:13.249 --> 22:15.584
You need to hide the gold bars
in a better spot.

22:16.627 --> 22:17.877
And you better not tell anyone.

22:17.878 --> 22:21.340
How the hell did Cha Yujin even find out
the gold was in the mine, let alone Park?

22:22.424 --> 22:24.634
Heeju, please.
Don't trust anyone.

22:24.635 --> 22:26.302
How many times do I have
to fucking tell you,

22:26.303 --> 22:27.470
don't trust anyone?

22:27.471 --> 22:29.056
Especially Lee Dokyung.
Got it?

22:44.321 --> 22:47.116
HEEJU, THIS IS DOKYUNG. I ESCAPED
FROM THE HOSPITAL. CALL ME AT THIS NUMBER.

23:01.922 --> 23:02.923
Hello?

23:03.716 --> 23:06.135
-  Dokyung?
- Heeju, you okay?

23:08.053 --> 23:11.139
Yeah, I'm okay.
I'm doing fine.

23:11.140 --> 23:12.557
How about you? You okay?

23:12.558 --> 23:14.601
Yeah, I'm okay.

23:14.602 --> 23:16.102
I'm so glad.

23:16.103 --> 23:17.980
I was so worried about you, Heeju.

23:18.397 --> 23:20.274
How did you get out
of the hospital?

23:21.150 --> 23:22.692
I ran away.

23:22.693 --> 23:25.362
Park found out where the casket was
and I couldn't get a hold of you.

23:26.363 --> 23:28.365
You got my message, right?

23:28.949 --> 23:30.242
And you moved all the gold bars?

23:31.869 --> 23:34.037
Actually, maybe we should talk in person.

23:34.038 --> 23:35.788
Where are you now?
I can come to you.

23:37.124 --> 23:39.167
Uh, no, I'll come to you.

23:39.168 --> 23:40.377
Where are you right now?

23:41.086 --> 23:42.296
I'm still in Yangpo.

23:44.715 --> 23:45.966
I'll meet you there.

23:46.550 --> 23:48.969
Get a hotel room and then just send me
a message.

23:50.262 --> 23:53.390
Right now it's a bit dangerous,
so I'll come by tonight.

23:56.435 --> 23:57.436
Okay.

23:59.688 --> 24:04.526
Uh, and hey,
where are the gold bars now?

24:08.864 --> 24:11.200
Let's meet first.
I'll tell you about it then.

24:12.201 --> 24:13.535
Okay.

24:24.505 --> 24:25.965
What is this?

24:31.303 --> 24:33.263
Ah, seriously?

24:33.931 --> 24:35.766
You looking to buy a car, sir?

24:36.600 --> 24:39.519
No, I'm here to talk to you, Heo Donggu.

24:39.520 --> 24:42.563
Why do you wanna talk to me?
I didn't do anything wrong.

24:42.564 --> 24:43.856
Yeah, yeah.

24:43.857 --> 24:45.442
Let's just go in the office, all right?

24:48.195 --> 24:50.571
Oh, great. Shit.

24:50.572 --> 24:52.157
RESIDENT REGISTRATION CARD
JU HARAN

24:53.242 --> 24:54.325
Ju Haran?

24:54.326 --> 24:55.452
Not Kim Heeju?

24:56.286 --> 24:57.578
Yeah.

24:57.579 --> 24:59.373
Why, did she cause some kind of accident?

25:00.082 --> 25:01.916
All I-all I did was sell her a car.

25:01.917 --> 25:04.837
Anything else, I don't-I don't-
I don't know anything about her.

25:07.089 --> 25:09.800
Well, it's just a little weird.
It was this woman, right?

25:12.553 --> 25:13.803
- Yeah.
-  It was?

25:13.804 --> 25:16.097
-  Yeah.
- Look. Different name.

25:16.098 --> 25:19.017
So it wasn't Cha Yujin.
It was Kim Heeju.

25:19.018 --> 25:22.145
Wait. So then are the police looking
for her,

25:22.146 --> 25:24.439
or is it the people from Geumseong?

25:24.440 --> 25:26.483
Was Park here? Park Hocheol?

25:27.026 --> 25:29.652
Park Hocheol?
That fucking asshole coming here?

25:29.653 --> 25:32.990
No way! I'd kill that fucker
if he shows his face here.

25:33.365 --> 25:34.449
Sure he wouldn't kill you?

25:34.450 --> 25:36.325
Hey, man, you haven't
seen me throw a punch, have you?

25:36.326 --> 25:39.704
I'd take him down. What,
y-you think I'm some kind of weakling?

25:39.705 --> 25:43.083
Punching doesn't really mean anything
when Park Hocheol pulls a knife on you.

25:43.459 --> 25:45.043
Hold on.

25:45.044 --> 25:48.088
If Park Hocheol is involved,
this is about Geumseong.

25:48.839 --> 25:51.758
Did this woman you're looking
for take something that belongs to them?

25:51.759 --> 25:53.676
Just call me if you see Park Hocheol.

25:53.677 --> 25:56.805
How many times do I have to say?
I told you he wouldn't dare.

25:57.389 --> 25:59.558
All right.
Look, I get it.

26:00.309 --> 26:02.895
You obviously don't like him at all.
Wanna kill him, right?

26:03.729 --> 26:06.065
Of course I do.
You see what that prick did to my ear?
:cue

26:07.816 --> 26:11.027
HAENGBOK PAWNSHOP

26:31.131 --> 26:33.132
Skyday, room 2014.

26:33.133 --> 26:35.010
You can reach me at this number
from now on.

27:01.912 --> 27:03.871
23rd floor.

27:03.872 --> 27:05.290
Doors closing.

27:28.897 --> 27:30.857
100 ten-kilo gold bars?

27:30.858 --> 27:31.859
Yes.

27:32.651 --> 27:33.652
What's the source?

27:34.528 --> 27:35.529
Cambodia.

27:36.196 --> 27:38.699
Hold up.
Is this about the recent leak?

27:40.492 --> 27:41.493
Yeah.

27:43.620 --> 27:47.708
So, it is stolen goods.
That's bold.

27:48.333 --> 27:52.003
Well, Interpol's lost the trace.

27:52.004 --> 27:55.299
No records left in any account.
It's clean.

27:55.841 --> 28:01.346
At the price from two years ago,
I'd say it's a win-win for both sides.

28:02.264 --> 28:04.224
I would like
to see the real thing first.

28:05.851 --> 28:07.102
When are you coming over?

28:08.562 --> 28:09.897
I will let you know.

28:11.189 --> 28:12.190
Okay.

28:24.578 --> 28:29.707
WHERE ARE YOU?
ABOUT CAMBODIA...

28:29.708 --> 28:31.084
INCOMING VOICE CALL

28:31.919 --> 28:33.462
Heeju, where are you?

28:34.171 --> 28:36.381
I just talked to the people who
are gonna buy our gold.

28:37.174 --> 28:39.343
We should be able to get a good price
for all the bars.

28:41.595 --> 28:43.429
Good job, Heeju.

28:43.430 --> 28:44.514
It's over.

28:45.265 --> 28:47.683
We can just start our new lives together.

28:51.229 --> 28:52.813
You still there?

28:52.814 --> 28:54.274
Heeju, did you hear me?

28:55.817 --> 28:57.861
- I'm here.
-  Okay.

28:58.612 --> 28:59.863
You heard what I said, right?

29:03.617 --> 29:05.535
They murdered Cha Yujin.

29:06.870 --> 29:08.663
Yeah, I know.

29:08.664 --> 29:10.999
That asshole Park called
and tried to blackmail me.

29:16.129 --> 29:17.172
But it's okay.

29:17.965 --> 29:19.466
We've got nothing
to worry about.

29:20.258 --> 29:24.345
I have other contacts at airport security
so moving the gold shouldn't be a problem.

29:24.346 --> 29:26.431
Our Cambodian buyers said they'd help, too.

29:27.683 --> 29:29.684
Cha Yujin told me everything.

29:29.685 --> 29:31.936
About how you two used to be together.

29:31.937 --> 29:33.729
It didn't mean anything, Heeju.

29:33.730 --> 29:36.023
I don't know what she told you,
but you're different.

29:36.024 --> 29:37.358
It's different with us.

29:37.359 --> 29:39.735
Sh-she's just-she's nothing to me.

29:39.736 --> 29:41.530
Someone close to you just died.

29:42.614 --> 29:45.325
And it's okay because someone else
can help with shipping?

29:50.330 --> 29:51.623
I guess you were right.

29:53.208 --> 29:55.918
Cha Yujin really meant nothing
to you at all.

29:55.919 --> 29:57.753
That's what I was trying
to tell you.

29:57.754 --> 29:59.296
No one else matters.

29:59.297 --> 30:00.424
:cue

30:01.299 --> 30:02.843
You're different from all of them.

30:12.769 --> 30:14.521
I think I've gone too far.

30:15.981 --> 30:18.400
Where are you now?
I can come find you.

30:19.443 --> 30:21.194
I don't think I can see you today.

30:21.987 --> 30:24.364
I'm sorry. I'll call you later.

30:28.285 --> 30:29.286
Wait.

31:01.359 --> 31:04.738
GANGWON SAEBAEK HOSPITAL

31:50.909 --> 31:52.410
What have you been doing?

31:55.622 --> 31:56.748
Auntie.

31:59.417 --> 32:01.920
Let me sleep here just tonight.

32:06.925 --> 32:08.468
I'm so tired.

32:15.517 --> 32:16.810
That's what it is.

32:18.395 --> 32:20.230
You smell like a coal mine.

32:25.068 --> 32:27.195
That damp coal smell.

32:29.156 --> 32:31.533
The one that miners have on their clothes.

32:45.172 --> 32:48.257
JEIL WORKSHOP

33:24.628 --> 33:25.629
Hoonseok?

33:29.174 --> 33:30.175
You brought it.

33:33.094 --> 33:34.095
Yeah.

33:35.138 --> 33:37.432
And the rest of the gold bars.

33:39.392 --> 33:40.810
Where are they?

33:49.945 --> 33:51.071
Tell me.

33:51.947 --> 33:53.531
Where did you hide the gold bars?
:cue

33:55.325 --> 33:56.576
I'm gonna shoot.

33:58.328 --> 33:59.871
Three.

34:04.626 --> 34:05.919
Two.

34:06.795 --> 34:08.129
One.

34:16.972 --> 34:18.222
Good.

34:18.223 --> 34:20.182
Good, you got it now.
No matter what happens,

34:20.183 --> 34:22.560
you never tell anybody where the bars are.

34:23.520 --> 34:25.939
Seriously, Heeju,
if I wanted to I could've just...

34:26.773 --> 34:29.067
...I mean, how the hell could you
even think of betraying me like that?

34:40.745 --> 34:41.871
Look.

34:42.622 --> 34:44.165
This potato's what saved your life.

34:46.876 --> 34:48.878
So did you meet up with Lee Dokyung?

34:50.213 --> 34:51.298
I didn't.

34:53.049 --> 34:54.050
Why not?

34:55.468 --> 34:57.304
Because I can't trust anyone.

34:57.804 --> 34:59.306
Not anymore.

35:00.223 --> 35:01.349
Wait a sec.

35:02.892 --> 35:05.770
So you're not going with Lee Dokyung?
Did you end things?

35:07.689 --> 35:11.484
Yes! Good job, Heeju!
You finally got it!

35:12.193 --> 35:14.403
Hell, you can't trust a guy like him!

35:14.404 --> 35:17.281
Heh, I was trying to tell you that
this whole time, and I-

35:17.282 --> 35:18.283
wait a minute.

35:19.409 --> 35:21.995
The thing is,
you still have all the gold bars.

35:22.621 --> 35:24.331
Is Dokyung really
just gonna walk away?

35:24.956 --> 35:27.125
Ah, shit.
Do I need to kill him?

35:27.709 --> 35:29.836
Don't think that I trust you, either.

35:31.630 --> 35:32.631
Okay.

35:33.923 --> 35:34.924
Be that way.

35:35.425 --> 35:36.426
You just use me.

35:37.093 --> 35:38.345
Keep on using me.

35:39.346 --> 35:40.764
As much as you want.

35:41.348 --> 35:42.807
Happy to be of service.

35:43.475 --> 35:47.186
For every two ten-kilo bars,
I get one one-kilo bar.

35:47.187 --> 35:48.188
Just one.

35:48.772 --> 35:50.273
Not too much, right?

35:50.940 --> 35:52.817
Oh, yeah. That reminds me.

35:53.193 --> 35:56.071
I did the math and it should take us
about six months to sell them all.

35:56.571 --> 35:57.572
Six.

36:00.784 --> 36:02.326
Park knows about me now.

36:02.327 --> 36:04.828
That means soon your whole company will, too.

36:04.829 --> 36:07.165
Not to mention the police on top of that.

36:08.708 --> 36:10.751
And you're telling me we have
to last six more months?

36:10.752 --> 36:12.879
No.
They don't know.

36:13.296 --> 36:15.048
Park? He doesn't know.

36:17.008 --> 36:19.177
Cha Yujin must have told Park about me.

36:19.719 --> 36:22.138
The gold bars, everything.
He must know.

36:24.933 --> 36:26.642
If Park had known it was you,

36:26.643 --> 36:28.478
he wouldn't have gone to the mine.

36:28.853 --> 36:30.563
He would have gone to the pawnshop.

36:32.565 --> 36:35.067
So now here's the real question.

36:37.362 --> 36:40.240
Park was alone. Why?

36:40.740 --> 36:42.533
After he killed Cha Yujin,

36:42.534 --> 36:44.993
he went to the mine alone
without telling anyone.

36:44.994 --> 36:45.995
Why did he do that?

36:48.915 --> 36:50.083
Because that way...

36:51.835 --> 36:54.838
- ...he could keep all the gold.
- Bingo.

36:55.463 --> 36:57.256
And he didn't want Chairman Ahn
to find out.

36:57.257 --> 36:58.299
Chairman Ahn?

36:59.843 --> 37:00.844
The real owner of the gold.

37:03.638 --> 37:06.057
Geumseong's chair,
Ahn Gyuseok.

37:07.142 --> 37:09.519
Chairman Ahn gets back
to Korea today.

37:11.229 --> 37:12.939
And that means Park is fucked.

37:14.107 --> 37:15.190
Welcome back, Chairman.

37:15.191 --> 37:16.526
Welcome back, sir!

37:17.277 --> 37:20.571
These are our partners
from Cambodia. Our executives.

37:20.572 --> 37:22.114
- Introduce yourselves.
- Yes, sir.

37:22.115 --> 37:24.408
- Director Jo.
- Thank you for coming all this way.

37:24.409 --> 37:26.201
These guys here, take care of 'em.

37:26.202 --> 37:27.745
- Nice to meet you.
- Give them anything they want.

37:27.746 --> 37:29.663
- You understand? Only the best.
- Of course, sir.

37:29.664 --> 37:30.915
This way, please.

37:33.626 --> 37:34.918
- Come here.
- Sir.

37:34.919 --> 37:35.962
What is this?

37:36.921 --> 37:38.006
Be more subtle.

37:39.132 --> 37:40.759
Apologies.
:cue

37:52.812 --> 37:54.022
Hey, step on it.

37:54.522 --> 37:58.026
My stomach is starting to hurt
from all that greasy food I had to eat.

38:04.324 --> 38:06.493
Do I really have to ask about it?

38:07.368 --> 38:08.661
Right, yes.

38:10.830 --> 38:13.583
- So, Lee Dokyung, he-
- Managed to escape from the hospital.

38:16.544 --> 38:18.086
You're kidding, right?

38:18.087 --> 38:20.214
Why did I have to hear that
from someone else?

38:20.215 --> 38:21.882
It seemed like you had a busy schedule,

38:21.883 --> 38:24.718
so I was planning to report it
to you when you got back.

38:24.719 --> 38:27.054
You do not make decisions for me.

38:27.055 --> 38:28.431
Yes, sir.

38:30.391 --> 38:31.476
So the casket.

38:32.018 --> 38:34.395
Is it waiting for us at the hotel?

38:35.688 --> 38:37.232
I'm sorry, sir.

38:38.441 --> 38:40.777
Enough with the apologizing
"I'm sorry" shit.

38:42.904 --> 38:45.031
You should know me better
than anyone else by now.

38:46.157 --> 38:48.742
Have I ever said anything about all
the bullshit,

38:48.743 --> 38:51.204
or the way you all stab each other in
the back?

38:51.746 --> 38:54.206
There's only one thing I can't forgive.

38:54.207 --> 38:57.293
And that's any damage to the company.
I will not let that happen.

38:59.295 --> 39:00.547
I take responsibility.

39:02.090 --> 39:03.424
I'll find the casket, sir.

39:06.052 --> 39:07.303
It's too late now.

39:20.900 --> 39:24.444
H.S HOTEL & RESORT CONSTRUCTION

39:42.422 --> 39:45.716
Huh, you know, maybe we dug
a little too deep.

39:46.926 --> 39:48.094
Hey, Park Hocheol.

39:50.263 --> 39:53.056
Look where you are.
Shit.

39:53.057 --> 39:54.434
Think carefully, now.

39:56.394 --> 39:58.730
How did you know what was in the casket?

39:59.272 --> 40:00.857
Kim Jinman, he...

40:01.816 --> 40:03.067
...he told me.

40:03.776 --> 40:05.110
Ah.

40:05.111 --> 40:07.655
So the police already found out about it.

40:08.823 --> 40:10.867
And you decided not to tell me.

40:11.451 --> 40:12.911
You didn't bring it up.

40:13.328 --> 40:14.411
So that meant-

40:18.625 --> 40:20.834
So that meant I couldn't-

40:20.835 --> 40:22.085
I couldn't tell you.

40:24.047 --> 40:26.256
That's not the reason.

40:26.257 --> 40:29.427
Otherwise, you would have
just asked me about it.

40:31.262 --> 40:33.764
Were you planning to find it
and take it for yourself?

40:35.308 --> 40:37.810
Or did you already do it,
and now you're lying?

40:38.144 --> 40:39.979
Did you plan this with Lee Dokyung?

40:41.147 --> 40:43.106
No. No, sir.

40:43.107 --> 40:44.399
Right.

40:44.400 --> 40:46.736
Because if you had,
you wouldn't still be in Geumseong.

40:51.699 --> 40:53.826
You probably would have fled already.

40:55.495 --> 40:57.413
Stay out of the business
with the casket.

40:58.623 --> 41:01.626
Go back to Yes Money
and keep doing what you used to do.
:cue

41:03.169 --> 41:05.671
Say hi to the shareholders
at Gold Land.

41:05.672 --> 41:07.382
Get 'em to sign that contract.

41:08.883 --> 41:12.803
Yeah, the more I think about it,
it's all you're really cut out for.

41:14.973 --> 41:16.182
Get him out.

41:18.059 --> 41:21.562
Fuck, I must be getting old now.
I'm getting a bit soft, huh?

41:24.774 --> 41:26.484
You know what?

41:27.402 --> 41:29.695
You should have reported
this whole thing right away.

41:29.696 --> 41:32.156
Coulda avoided the Chairman's wrath.

41:35.910 --> 41:37.912
You got pretty lucky in the end, though.

41:38.329 --> 41:40.288
I mean, he wanted
to cut your ear off.

41:40.289 --> 41:41.708
I barely talked him out of it.

41:42.750 --> 41:44.876
Mm, from now on,

41:44.877 --> 41:47.296
you should keep your head down
at Yes Money. Gimmie that.

41:48.006 --> 41:50.633
I'll take care of the gold bars, okay?
Here.

41:51.134 --> 41:52.301
Come on, Park.

41:53.344 --> 41:55.513
How did you know about the gold bars?

41:56.514 --> 41:58.640
I was in Yangpo then, wasn't I?

42:00.268 --> 42:02.520
I sent the casket.
I've always known.

42:03.187 --> 42:06.773
You've lost your fucking touch,
you know know that?

42:08.943 --> 42:10.570
You don't know your place.

42:11.529 --> 42:13.113
Hey, here you go.

42:14.449 --> 42:15.742
Good luck getting out of there!

43:09.378 --> 43:11.130
Park isn't the only one.

43:11.631 --> 43:13.590
I think someone else saw me, too.

43:13.591 --> 43:15.134
What do you mean?
Who saw you?

43:16.427 --> 43:17.428
Kim Jinman.

43:19.055 --> 43:21.599
I think he saw me getting
into my car that night.

43:22.850 --> 43:26.144
When I was running away from
the Jeongsan nightclub with Cha Yujin.

43:26.145 --> 43:27.896
Listen to me! Open the door!

43:27.897 --> 43:30.107
Look, look, look!
Roll, roll, roll down your window!

43:30.108 --> 43:32.526
He must not have seen you
'cause he would have reported you

43:32.527 --> 43:33.945
to my company right away.

43:34.987 --> 43:36.280
Yeah, but you know...

43:37.156 --> 43:40.283
...what if he's not saying anything
because he wants the gold for himself?

43:40.284 --> 43:42.285
Park never said anything, either.

43:42.286 --> 43:43.913
Ah, shit.

43:46.749 --> 43:47.750
Heeju.

43:48.417 --> 43:51.295
Your old phone and credit card.
You threw those away, right?

43:53.881 --> 43:55.508
Then you got no choice.

43:57.510 --> 43:59.637
You have to be Ju Haran
for the rest of your life.

44:02.431 --> 44:04.225
Don't worry about it.

44:05.268 --> 44:06.727
If Detective Kim finds out...

44:07.478 --> 44:09.188
...then I'll simply go
and kill him for you.

44:10.690 --> 44:12.358
Then you can give me
an extra potato.

44:14.402 --> 44:15.403
Deal?
:cue

44:19.365 --> 44:20.448
Hello.

44:28.875 --> 44:30.585
Hi, there. Hey.

44:31.252 --> 44:33.128
Uh, room five.

44:33.129 --> 44:35.172
Was Yeo Sunok discharged already?

44:35.173 --> 44:37.800
Uh, no. She was moved
to a private room.

44:38.426 --> 44:39.594
- She was?
-  Yes.

44:41.846 --> 44:43.306
Wow, so pretty!

44:45.641 --> 44:47.309
Now, here.

44:47.310 --> 44:48.560
Ah!

44:48.561 --> 44:51.438
Oh, wow.
What a nice room you got here.

44:51.439 --> 44:52.564
- Huh?
-  Sorry, who-

44:52.565 --> 44:54.734
-  Must be pretty expensive.
-  Who are you?

44:55.067 --> 44:56.151
Oh.

44:56.152 --> 44:57.278
Is he from the ER?

44:57.778 --> 45:00.281
- Could you just give us a second?
-  Hmm?

45:01.991 --> 45:02.992
Oh.

45:06.120 --> 45:09.706
This really is a nice room.
Wow.

45:10.958 --> 45:13.544
When were you put in here?
Damn, look at this view.

45:14.253 --> 45:15.838
Isn't it too expensive, though?

45:16.339 --> 45:17.505
Why are you here?

45:17.506 --> 45:19.507
Just wanted to say hi
to an old friend.

45:19.508 --> 45:20.717
Can't a guy do that?

45:20.718 --> 45:23.638
Who knows?
We might not have much time left.

45:24.472 --> 45:26.640
I'm not just talkin' about you.

45:26.641 --> 45:30.310
I mean, at our age, who doesn't have some
kind of illness or some other kinda shit?

45:30.311 --> 45:32.103
I got diabetes.

45:32.104 --> 45:33.772
And my liver's not great, either.

45:33.773 --> 45:36.191
I could go any day now, you know?

45:39.487 --> 45:40.779
Hey.

45:40.780 --> 45:42.572
Isn't it weird we both live in Jeongsan

45:42.573 --> 45:44.741
but we've never run
into each other before now?

45:44.742 --> 45:46.786
More like we pretended not to.

45:47.536 --> 45:49.663
I saw you a couple times.

45:49.664 --> 45:50.831
Why didn't you say anything?

45:52.917 --> 45:54.377
What's the point in that?

45:55.294 --> 45:57.212
There's nothing left between us.

46:00.341 --> 46:01.342
And your husband?

46:02.134 --> 46:03.261
Has he come to see you?

46:04.387 --> 46:05.930
No, he hasn't.

46:06.889 --> 46:09.057
Well, still, doesn't seem like
he's that bad of a guy.

46:09.058 --> 46:10.393
I mean, he even dropped the charges...

46:13.187 --> 46:15.564
If you're done saying hi,
you should just go.

46:16.274 --> 46:19.359
Instead of hanging around here,
dredging up old memories.

46:19.360 --> 46:21.445
Ah, come on, now.
Don't be like that.

46:23.447 --> 46:25.032
Oh, by the way.
Who is Ju Haran?

46:25.825 --> 46:28.618
I asked at the front desk
and the receptionist said Ju Haran

46:28.619 --> 46:30.705
is your guardian,
but I thought it'd be Han Cheoljung.

46:31.622 --> 46:32.706
I don't know.

46:32.707 --> 46:34.249
What do you mean?
It's your guardian.

46:34.250 --> 46:35.626
Don't tell me you don't know.

46:37.878 --> 46:39.088
Here, wait.

46:40.381 --> 46:41.382
Look at this.

46:42.258 --> 46:43.259
It's her.

46:43.926 --> 46:45.011
Yeah.

46:45.720 --> 46:46.721
Right?

46:47.763 --> 46:49.806
Must be. Yeah.

46:49.807 --> 46:52.601
I remember seeing her here the other day
when I came to visit you.

46:53.561 --> 46:54.936
It is her, right?

46:56.355 --> 46:57.731
But then I thought,

46:57.732 --> 47:00.901
"This woman's name is Kim Heeju, right?"

47:01.527 --> 47:02.652
Who is she?

47:02.653 --> 47:03.696
Your daughter?

47:04.780 --> 47:05.781
No.

47:06.240 --> 47:07.574
My niece.

47:07.575 --> 47:08.617
Your niece?

47:09.368 --> 47:11.203
I didn't know that you had a niece.

47:11.746 --> 47:13.956
- I do.
-  I see.

47:14.540 --> 47:18.002
Oh, so then your niece,
she must be pretty well-off, right?

47:18.961 --> 47:20.378
She got you into this fancy room

47:20.379 --> 47:21.672
and already took care
of your hospital bills.

47:23.132 --> 47:24.507
Where does she live?

47:24.508 --> 47:25.884
Jeongsan?

47:25.885 --> 47:27.303
When is she back?

47:28.262 --> 47:29.263
I don't know.

47:30.556 --> 47:32.975
She stopped by when she heard I was sick.

47:33.684 --> 47:34.769
Why do you ask?

47:35.811 --> 47:38.646
Why do you wanna know when she'll be here?

47:38.647 --> 47:41.108
Well, you told me she's your niece,
so I'd like to meet her.

47:41.942 --> 47:43.235
What? Why?

47:43.819 --> 47:45.488
Has she been gambling or something?

47:45.988 --> 47:47.280
Is she in trouble?

47:47.281 --> 47:48.282
No.

47:49.075 --> 47:50.284
Then...

47:50.951 --> 47:53.204
...did she murder someone
or anything like that?

47:53.621 --> 47:56.289
Come on.
What an awful thing to say.

47:56.290 --> 47:57.749
Nothing like that.

47:57.750 --> 47:59.627
No, she just borrowed some money.

48:00.628 --> 48:02.295
- How much was it?
-  A lot.

48:02.296 --> 48:03.798
Actually...

48:04.590 --> 48:06.175
...it's not just about the money.

48:06.967 --> 48:09.637
Though I'd hate for someone her age
to end up with a criminal record.

48:10.096 --> 48:11.971
It's not too late for her
to pay it back.

48:11.972 --> 48:13.973
Or if that's not possible,

48:13.974 --> 48:16.309
then she could try and reach some kind
of settlement at least.

48:16.310 --> 48:19.271
Looks like she turned off her phone,
and disappeared instead.

48:20.398 --> 48:21.565
That's why I brought her up.

48:22.066 --> 48:24.401
So if she calls you or comes to visit,

48:24.402 --> 48:25.903
please be sure to let me know.

48:26.529 --> 48:28.613
I'll be more than happy
to help her settle the matter.

48:28.614 --> 48:29.740
All right?

48:30.282 --> 48:31.699
Don't tell her I was here, though.

48:31.700 --> 48:34.120
If she knows the police are involved,
she won't show up.

48:37.540 --> 48:41.168
There's nothing to worry about, hmm?
I won't do anything to your niece.

48:41.627 --> 48:44.421
-  Call me, okay?
-  Ms. Yeo Sunok?

48:44.422 --> 48:45.923
I need to check your temperature.

48:46.882 --> 48:47.883
:cue

48:49.093 --> 48:50.094
Huh?

48:54.390 --> 48:57.183
All right.
I'll head out now.

48:57.184 --> 48:58.978
You'll give me a call, right?

48:59.937 --> 49:00.938
Yeah.

49:02.731 --> 49:04.692
Take care of yourself.
Get some rest.

50:01.499 --> 50:03.125
Hey, Heeju.
Where are you?

50:06.212 --> 50:07.837
- Uh, Dokyung-
-  Tell me where you are

50:07.838 --> 50:09.340
and I'll come find you
so we can talk.

50:17.473 --> 50:19.390
I'm not really sure that's a good idea.

50:21.894 --> 50:24.480
Do you think we can go back
to how things used to be?

50:25.481 --> 50:26.607
What do you mean?

50:27.858 --> 50:30.109
Is it-is this because
of the whole Cha Yujin thing

50:30.110 --> 50:31.570
because I never told you about her?

50:36.158 --> 50:37.867
You're right.

50:37.868 --> 50:40.246
I took advantage of a woman I was dating,
but Heeju...

50:41.121 --> 50:42.498
...it's different with us.

50:44.083 --> 50:45.251
I think that...

50:46.252 --> 50:49.004
...I was actually
the one taking advantage of you.

50:49.797 --> 50:50.798
When we first met...

50:51.757 --> 50:53.759
...I saw you as my only way out.

50:55.010 --> 50:58.179
No, Heeju, it's okay.
We can be happy like before.

50:58.180 --> 51:00.849
That money will fix everything.
What more could we need?

51:04.395 --> 51:05.646
Yangpo is out.

51:06.230 --> 51:08.274
They've tightened up security.
It's too risky.

51:09.650 --> 51:12.319
So I was thinking
a boat might be our best bet.

51:13.529 --> 51:14.655
We stowaway?

51:15.281 --> 51:16.282
Mm-hmm.

51:17.241 --> 51:20.494
I know someone who uses
cargo ships to export cars.

51:22.162 --> 51:23.539
How do you know them?

51:25.583 --> 51:27.418
Turns out money can do anything.

51:27.918 --> 51:30.588
Okay, then.
Let's move as quickly as possible.

51:31.088 --> 51:33.215
No, I'm not going with you.

51:33.757 --> 51:35.009
You're going by yourself.

51:35.593 --> 51:37.386
And the gold bars...

51:39.221 --> 51:40.431
...we should split them.

51:41.015 --> 51:42.016
What?

51:42.683 --> 51:43.684
I...

51:44.602 --> 51:47.145
I think I deserve at least that much.
Don't you?

51:47.146 --> 51:50.357
I risked my life to keep them hidden.
So here's what we'll do.

51:50.983 --> 51:55.111
On the day you head for Cambodia,
I'll bring your share by car.

51:55.112 --> 51:56.904
I'll bring your passport, too.

51:56.905 --> 51:58.782
So you can just meet me at the port.

52:00.618 --> 52:02.952
And you won't try and find the rest
of the gold bars.

52:02.953 --> 52:05.163
What? Heeju.
What are you talking about?

52:05.164 --> 52:07.290
Look, tell me where you are.

52:07.291 --> 52:08.667
Can we please just talk about this
in person?

52:09.418 --> 52:10.502
Whatever you say.

52:11.045 --> 52:13.379
We can just split the gold bars,
if that's what you want.

52:13.380 --> 52:15.049
But can we at least talk in person?

52:15.591 --> 52:16.799
Where are you now?

52:16.800 --> 52:18.343
Are you still staying at the pawnshop?

52:18.344 --> 52:20.262
No, I'm not there anymore.

52:20.888 --> 52:22.014
Don't go there.

52:22.598 --> 52:24.558
And don't come looking for me, either.

52:27.102 --> 52:28.771
Wait, Hee-Heeju.

52:35.569 --> 52:37.988
INCOMING CALL

52:44.453 --> 52:45.995
POWER OFF

53:00.302 --> 53:03.137
Your call has been
forwarded to an automated voice-

53:05.933 --> 53:08.351
Fuck! Why are you doing this?

53:12.940 --> 53:14.400
:cue

53:26.161 --> 53:27.745
Boss.

53:27.746 --> 53:29.206
I want to repay you for everything.

53:29.998 --> 53:33.752
I know this isn't anything special,
but I made it for you.

53:34.253 --> 53:35.254
Here.

53:37.172 --> 53:39.508
It's a four-leaf clover.
It brings good luck.

53:41.135 --> 53:44.680
So if you wear it then you'll be lucky.

53:46.849 --> 53:49.559
Oh, I made it with my own share
of the potatoes,

53:49.560 --> 53:51.520
so you don't have to worry about that.

53:53.230 --> 53:54.480
Is that true?

53:54.481 --> 53:55.482
What?

53:56.442 --> 53:57.693
If I keep this with me...

53:59.653 --> 54:02.114
...will it really bring good luck,
even to me?

54:02.698 --> 54:05.325
Um, well, no.

54:05.909 --> 54:08.494
It's just a superstition, of course.

54:08.495 --> 54:13.625
But believing in things like that
can still bring us comfort.

54:24.511 --> 54:25.512
Thank you.

54:26.513 --> 54:29.475
Take care of yourself, Heeju.

54:41.612 --> 54:43.738
All right.
So what'd he say?

54:56.460 --> 54:57.628
By the way.

54:59.171 --> 55:02.256
Heeju, do you have to go this far?

55:02.257 --> 55:03.717
Just for Lee Dokyung?

55:04.801 --> 55:06.678
I mean, you're helping with his travel.

55:08.388 --> 55:10.182
And giving him half
of the gold bars, too.

55:13.685 --> 55:16.438
I just, I overheard you talking on
the phone yesterday.

55:17.397 --> 55:19.107
It's not like I meant to.

55:19.358 --> 55:21.317
It was an accident!
It was.

55:21.318 --> 55:23.903
I went back to grab something I left
and I heard you.

55:23.904 --> 55:25.989
It really, really was an accident.

55:30.536 --> 55:32.079
It was his to begin with.

55:32.788 --> 55:35.331
I figured I should give him his share.

55:35.332 --> 55:37.625
Lee Dokyung's share
is half of the bars?

55:37.626 --> 55:38.961
Really?

55:39.545 --> 55:41.003
Heeju, do you-

55:41.004 --> 55:42.548
do you still love that asshole?

55:43.090 --> 55:45.716
Huh? Even after everything he did to you?

55:45.717 --> 55:47.219
Didn't you break up already?

55:48.387 --> 55:49.513
Yeah, we did.

55:53.058 --> 55:54.268
We're breaking up.

55:55.435 --> 55:58.104
But it's not like I want him
to be unhappy.

55:58.105 --> 55:59.690
What does that even mean?

56:00.941 --> 56:02.942
Ugh, I don't know.
Leave me alone.

56:02.943 --> 56:04.193
It's my gold anyway.

56:04.194 --> 56:05.404
No, it's mine, too!

56:06.446 --> 56:09.116
Of those 100 gold bars,
5% belongs to me.

56:10.492 --> 56:12.368
You're just gonna give half to Dokyung?

56:12.369 --> 56:13.370
Okay, then.

56:13.829 --> 56:15.664
You can have 10% of my share.

56:16.248 --> 56:19.751
For every ten-kilo gold bar I cash in,
you get a one-kilo bar.

56:20.043 --> 56:21.044
Sound good?

56:25.424 --> 56:27.384
Wait a minute.
Let me just do the math.

56:28.010 --> 56:29.636
Four, five, six, seven.

56:30.679 --> 56:32.556
Ten billion?

56:34.558 --> 56:35.642
I get ten billion?

56:39.688 --> 56:43.525
Wow! Ten bill! Fuck me!

56:44.067 --> 56:45.777
Is that enough for you?

56:46.278 --> 56:47.738
That's all you've ever wanted?
:cue

56:49.156 --> 56:50.991
Why?

56:52.784 --> 56:54.161
Will you give me more if I ask?

56:56.496 --> 56:58.081
No, I was just wondering.

56:58.665 --> 57:00.292
You'd do anything for money.

57:00.751 --> 57:02.502
Yet you've been the least greedy.

57:04.046 --> 57:08.050
Every other person around me has tried
to steal everything I had.

57:09.384 --> 57:11.803
Really? Huh.
I, uh, never thought about it.

57:32.491 --> 57:34.700
Hi, good evening.
Did you order express delivery?

57:34.701 --> 57:35.785
Yeah.

57:35.786 --> 57:36.828
Okay.

58:08.860 --> 58:11.404
HAENGBOK PAWNSHOP

58:55.282 --> 58:56.283
Fuck.

01:00:06.478 --> 01:00:07.479
Why are you here?

01:00:08.647 --> 01:00:09.689
H-Heeju.

01:00:12.067 --> 01:00:14.736
:cue

01:01:10.667 --> 01:01:15.379
♪ Another day another hour ♪

01:01:15.380 --> 01:01:19.758
♪ Free falling in my mind ♪

01:01:19.759 --> 01:01:26.766
♪ I will find all of the reasons
for leaving ♪

01:01:29.102 --> 01:01:34.273
♪ When everyone around me's changing ♪

01:01:34.274 --> 01:01:38.736
♪ Everyone but me ♪

01:01:38.737 --> 01:01:43.074
♪ All the things I thought I could be ♪

01:01:44.159 --> 01:01:46.620
♪ Are out of reach ♪

01:01:48.538 --> 01:01:53.208
♪ I leave it all behind ♪

01:01:53.209 --> 01:01:57.254
♪ As you fall in line ♪

01:01:57.255 --> 01:02:01.842
♪ I'm not expecting any light
at your door ♪

01:02:01.843 --> 01:02:03.594
♪ There's nothing left ♪

01:02:03.595 --> 01:02:09.934
♪ Just the pieces of everything
we could have been before ♪

01:02:09.935 --> 01:02:14.229
♪ Evermore ♪

01:02:14.230 --> 01:02:20.152
♪ I don't feel it like I used to ♪

01:02:20.153 --> 01:02:22.405
♪ Anymore ♪

01:02:35.043 --> 01:02:39.713
♪ You could find me in the dark ♪

01:02:39.714 --> 01:02:44.009
♪ Still calling through the night ♪

01:02:44.010 --> 01:02:48.973
♪ I leave behind all of the seasons ♪

01:02:48.974 --> 01:02:51.643
♪ I've dreamed of ♪

01:02:54.020 --> 01:03:01.026
♪ But the water's rising over
everything I've known ♪

01:03:01.027 --> 01:03:07.033
♪ Drifting out here all alone ♪

01:03:08.660 --> 01:03:12.830
♪ On your own ♪

01:03:12.831 --> 01:03:17.459
♪ So leave it all behind ♪

01:03:17.460 --> 01:03:21.922
♪ As you fall in line ♪

01:03:21.923 --> 01:03:26.301
♪ I'm not expecting any light
at your door ♪

01:03:26.302 --> 01:03:27.970
♪ There's nothing left ♪

01:03:27.971 --> 01:03:34.184
♪ Just the pieces of everything
we could have been before ♪

01:03:34.185 --> 01:03:38.564
♪ Evermore ♪

01:03:38.565 --> 01:03:41.109
♪ I don't... ♪
